Board contents, audit logs, and other artifacts produced by the Software are also
covered by this license.

The Software incorporates third-party open source software, which remains governed
by its own license terms; see DESIGN.md, section "Tech Stack". The Software does
not probe resources and invokes no external command for that purpose; choosing and
running such means is the user's responsibility. Any distribution must include
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md carrying the required notices.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. THE COPYRIGHT
HOLDER SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM
THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE. The Software shares resource usage information; it does
not guarantee mutual exclusion, and by design it fails open.

Governed by the laws of Japan. In case of any discrepancy, the Japanese text above
prevails.

